       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PKDEC01.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY B: DATA HIERARCHY - PACKED DECIMAL (COMP-3) AND BINARY (COMP) LEDGER
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  GENERAL-LEDGER-RECORD.
           05  GL-ACCOUNT-NUMBER       PIC 9(8) COMP VALUE 10042000.
           05  FISCAL-YEAR             PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 2026.
           05  ACCOUNTING-PERIOD       PIC 9(2) COMP VALUE 09.
           05  BEGINNING-BALANCE       PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE +000450000.00.
           05  PERIOD-DEBITS           PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE +000085200.50.
           05  PERIOD-CREDITS          PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE +000062100.25.
           05  ENDING-BALANCE          PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE +000000000.00.
           05  VARIANCE-AMOUNT         PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE +000000000.00.
       01  LEDGER-AUDIT-FLAGS.
           05  IS-BALANCED-FLAG        PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
           05  IS-OVERDRAWN-FLAG       PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
           05  AUDIT-EXCEPTION-CODE    PIC X(4) VALUE 'NONE'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-CALCULATE-GL-BALANCE.
           PERFORM 1000-COMPUTE-ENDING-BALANCE
           PERFORM 2000-PERFORM-AUDIT-CHECKS
           GOBACK.

       1000-COMPUTE-ENDING-BALANCE.
           COMPUTE ENDING-BALANCE = BEGINNING-BALANCE + PERIOD-DEBITS - PERIOD-CREDITS
           COMPUTE VARIANCE-AMOUNT = PERIOD-DEBITS - PERIOD-CREDITS.

       2000-PERFORM-AUDIT-CHECKS.
           IF ENDING-BALANCE < 0
               MOVE 'Y' TO IS-OVERDRAWN-FLAG
               MOVE 'OVRD' TO AUDIT-EXCEPTION-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 'N' TO IS-OVERDRAWN-FLAG
           END-IF
           IF VARIANCE-AMOUNT = 0
               MOVE 'Y' TO IS-BALANCED-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE 'N' TO IS-BALANCED-FLAG
           END-IF.
